PRINTFORML S04_RESULTS_1=%RESULTS:1%
PRINTFORML S04_RESULTS_10=%RESULTS:10%
PRINTFORML S04_RESULTS_11=%RESULTS:11%
PRINTFORML S04_RESULTS_12=%RESULTS:12%
PRINTFORML S04_RESULTS_13=%RESULTS:13%
PRINTFORML S04_FLAGS={FLAG:90}/{FLAG:91}
INPUT
RETURN
